<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Product Gallery | GramBazaar</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
</head>
<body>

<header class="header">
  <nav class="nav">
    <a class="logo" href="home-page.html">Gram<span>Bazaar</span></a>

    <div class="navlinks">
      <a href="home-page.html">Home</a>
      <a href="clay-products.html">Clay Products</a>
      <a href="images.html">Gallery</a>
      <a href="about.html">About</a>
      <a href="User- cart.html">Cart (<b data-cart-count>0</b>)</a>
    </div>
  </nav>
</header>

<main class="container">

  <div class="page-title">
    <span class="eyebrow">Village creativity</span>
    <h1>Product Gallery</h1>
    <p class="muted">
      A collection of traditional products and crafts.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="gallery">
    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1578749556568-bc2c40e68b61?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Clay pottery">

    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1603006905003-be475563bc59?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Traditional diya">

    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1590736969955-71cc94901144?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Woven basket">

    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1587049352846-4a222e784d38?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Honey">

    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1616486338812-3dadae4b4ace?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Home decor">

    <img src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1574323347407-f5e1ad6d020b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=800&q=80" alt="Grains">
  </div>

  <p class="notice" style="margin-top:20px">
    अपनी दुकान की वास्तविक फोटो लगाएँ, ताकि ग्राहक उत्पाद को सही तरीके से पहचान सकें।
  </p>

</main>

<footer class="footer">
  <div class="footer-inner">
    <div>
      <h2>GramBazaar</h2>
      <p>Supporting local village products.</p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Explore</h3>
      <p><a href="home-page.html">Home</a></p>
      <p><a href="clay-products.html">Clay Products</a></p>
    </div>
    <div>
      <h3>Help</h3>
      <p><a href="about.html">About Us</a></p>
      <p><a href="User- cart.html">Shopping Cart</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>

<script src="app.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
